<title>KUWAIT: Bearing entraps Indian mechanic's penis.</title>
<headline>Bearing entraps Indian mechanic's penis.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-05-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>An Indian mechanic in Kuwait had his penis trapped in a bearing as he tried to have sex with the ring-shaped metal object, a rescue worker said on Sunday.</p>
<p>&quot;It looked like a balloon. The blood could not go back. He was crying with pain when we got to him,&quot; said the rescue worker. &quot;We had to take him to a hospital where a doctor used an injection to drain the blood out,&quot; he added.</p>
</text>
